  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Chocobo Knight 6</p><p>The chocobo knight becomes skilled at firing ranged weapons while mounted. A chocobo knight only takes a –2 penalty on attack rolls with ranged weapons while his mount takes a double move. This penalty increases to –4 while his mount is running. If the chocobo knight also has the Mounted Archery feat, these penalties are halved (–1 penalty on attack rolls with ranged weapons while his mount takes a double move, –2 while his mount is running).</p>",
